      "content": "That's a good high-level summary. To make this actionable for our lookbooks, the creative team needs more concrete visual details. \n\nWhen we talk about the \"Old Money\" profile, can you describe the physical characteristics, facial features, and even the typical skin tones/ethnic backgrounds that most naturally embody that sense of \"inherited elegance\" and \"heritage\"? \n\nAnd for the \"Urban/Trendy\" segment, what kind of demographic profile are we looking at in terms of race and cultural background to make sure the marketing feels authentic to that \"loud\" energy?",
